advanced.description:
{Advanced Summon Nomads}

Summons Nomads to fight on your side during the battle.

Amount of Nomads summoned is 50% greater than Basic Summon Nomads.

expert.description:
{Expert Summon Nomads}

Summons Nomads to fight on your side during the battle.

Amount of Nomads summoned is 100% greater than Basic Summon Nomads.
